{"generated_at": "2026-10-19T18:51:12.408213+00:00", "slug": "issue-victim-services-live", "title": "Family violence, victims' services and funding, 19 days of posts", "stats": {"posts_processed": 6, "claims": 13, "clusters": 11, "checkable": 11, "verified": 2, "unsupported_spreading": 0, "cross_platform": 0, "news_checked": 2, "crossed_over": 0}, "clusters": [{"event": null, "event_type": null, "news": {"articles": 0, "sources": 0, "sources_48h": 0, "articles_48h": 0, "first_news_at": null, "news_before_x": false, "top_domains": [], "covered": true, "lean_mix": {"L": 0, "C": 0, "R": 0, "?": 0, "rated": 0, "texas": 0, "one_sided": null}, "checked_at": "2026-10-17T19:22+00:00"}, "id": 1, "text": "Ken Paxton's office negotiated a plea deal reducing felony charges against Adam Hoffman, a former Waco attorney, to misdemeanors.", "type": "fact", "checkable": true, "stance": "against", "entities": ["Ken Paxton", "Adam Hoffman"], "verdict": "supported", "verdict_basis": "PolitiFact's fact-check reports that prosecutors in Paxton's office offered Hoffman a misdemeanor plea after a 2025 hung jury, and that Hoffman admitted to the lesser charge of \"indecent assault\" (politifact.com). Chron and Yahoo News add that he pleaded guilty in April 2026 to two misdemeanors, indecent assault and displaying harmful materials to a minor. Those pleas replaced a first-degree felony charge of continuous sexual abuse of a child. Newsweek quotes the office's May 15 letter to Rep. Jeff Leach, which defended the deal because the child would not testify at a retrial. Hoffman's defense lawyer told Newsweek that Paxton personally \"had nothing to do\" with the outcome. That doesn't contradict the claim, which attributes the deal to Paxton's office and not to Paxton himself. The claim is accurate as worded.", "verdict_sources": ["https://politifact.com/factchecks/2026/jun/03/james-talarico/ken-paxton-adam-hoffman-plea-deal-Texas-Senate/", "https://www.chron.com/news/article/texas-attorney-abuse-jail-release-22275459.php", "https://www.newsweek.com/who-is-adam-hoffman-james-talarico-attacks-ken-paxton-over-plea-deal-12095354", "https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/maga-candidate-ken-paxton-defends-012450558.html"], "posts": 2, "views": 166798, "accounts": 2, "copies": 0, "pushback_posts": 0, "lanes": [{"key": "lenient_justice", "label": "Abusers get lenient deals", "color": "#c98500", "posts": 2}], "first_seen": "2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", "first_handle": "theliamnissan", "first_handles": ["theliamnissan", "corblanksma"], "first_url": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558", "first_source": "x", "first_name": "Liam Nissan™", "sources": {"x": {"posts": 2, "views": 166798, "engagement": 5353, "first_seen": "2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", "first_handle": "theliamnissan", "first_url": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558"}}, "cross_platform": false, "platform_lag_h": null, "first_views": 160106, "first_followers": 467862, "last_seen": "2026-10-12T20:54:48+00:00", "views_24h": 0, "series": [["2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", 160106], ["2026-10-12T20:54:48+00:00", 6692]], "top_post": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558"}, {"event": null, "event_type": null, "news": {"articles": 0, "sources": 0, "sources_48h": 0, "articles_48h": 0, "first_news_at": null, "news_before_x": false, "top_domains": [], "covered": true, "lean_mix": {"L": 0, "C": 0, "R": 0, "?": 0, "rated": 0, "texas": 0, "one_sided": null}, "checked_at": "2026-10-17T19:22+00:00"}, "id": 2, "text": "Adam Hoffman committed a harmful act against a child.", "type": "fact", "checkable": true, "stance": "against", "entities": ["Adam Hoffman"], "verdict": "supported", "verdict_basis": "Adam Dean Hoffman, a former Waco attorney, \npleaded guilty on April 16 to indecent assault and displaying harmful materials to a minor, both Class A misdemeanors\n (KWTX). That is an admission in court of harmful conduct involving a child, so the claim as worded has a solid basis. The original charge was continuous sexual abuse of a young child. \nThat trial ended in a mistrial in June 2025 after jurors deadlocked 7-5 in favor of guilt\n, so he was never convicted of the felony. The pleas came through a deal with the Attorney General's office, and a visiting judge then \nsentenced him to 60 days in jail, doubling the 30-day plea deal\n. The Texas Tribune and KWTX reporting, along with the Newsweek and Spectrum News coverage, describe the victim as a young boy who was a friend of Hoffman's son. The claim is worded generally, and the guilty pleas back it up. A stronger claim, such as a felony conviction or rape, would not be supported by the court outcome.", "verdict_sources": ["https://www.kwtx.com/2026/05/15/texas-ag-ken-paxton-has-ignored-requests-explain-adam-hoffmans-plea-deal-house-judiciary-chair-says/", "https://www.kwtx.com/2026/04/27/disgraced-former-attorney-adam-hoffman-begins-serving-60-day-jail-sentence/", "https://www.texastribune.org/2026/05/19/ken-paxton-waco-plea-deal-child-sex-abuse-texas-attorney-general/"], "posts": 1, "views": 160106, "accounts": 1, "copies": 0, "pushback_posts": 0, "lanes": [{"key": "lenient_justice", "label": "Abusers get lenient deals", "color": "#c98500", "posts": 1}], "first_seen": "2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", "first_handle": "theliamnissan", "first_handles": ["theliamnissan"], "first_url": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558", "first_source": "x", "first_name": "Liam Nissan™", "sources": {"x": {"posts": 1, "views": 160106, "engagement": 5244, "first_seen": "2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", "first_handle": "theliamnissan", "first_url": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558"}}, "cross_platform": false, "platform_lag_h": null, "first_views": 160106, "first_followers": 467862, "last_seen": "2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", "views_24h": 0, "series": [["2026-10-12T20:52:02+00:00", 160106]], "top_post": "https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2109748955508875558"}, {"event": 